================================================================================
Reference specification (reimplemented, not vendored)
================================================================================
The seal wire format (`apohara-seal-v1`), layer semantics, and conformance
test vectors are a clean-room Rust reimplementation derived from the Python
reference implementation `core/seal` in the apohara-probanza monorepo,
which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

  apohara-probanza / core/seal — Copyright the Apohara authors — Apache-2.0

Where the Python reference is internally inconsistent (the C2PA manifest hash
input and the Rekor signed-checkpoint verification), this Rust implementation
defines the canonical `apohara-seal-v1` behavior and documents the divergence.

